# Local network ranges: traffic to these destinations bypasses the proxy.
# These ranges also become throw routes in the OpenClash proxy routing table,
# so remote private ranges that must be proxied have to stay out of this list.
# One entry per line, '#' starts a comment (inline comments are allowed).
0.0.0.0/8        # this network
10.0.0.0/8       # private
100.64.0.0/10    # shared address space (CGNAT, used by Tailscale)
127.0.0.0/8      # loopback
169.254.0.0/16   # link-local
172.16.0.0/12    # private
192.168.0.0/16   # private
224.0.0.0/4      # multicast
240.0.0.0/4      # reserved
